    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This residence which was originally constructed circa 1900 is traditional in layout and design and presents an opportunity to acquire an excellent standard of accommodation situated in a desirable and convenient location. There are many attractive features.\n\nGROUND FLOOR\n\nENTRANCE PATIO: 1.00m x 2.00m\nSliding patio entrance door. Ceramic tile over concrete floor. Entrance door to hallway.\n\nENTRANCE HALL: 1.00m x 0.85m\nLinoleum over concrete floor.\n\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM: 4.00m x 3.20m\nLinoleum over concrete floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling. Kitchen with over-counter storage, cooker, fridge, freezer and oil burning stove. Wall hung central heating radiator.\n\nBACK HALL (UNDER STAIRS):2.65m x 0.85m\nLinoleum over concrete floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling. Ceramic tile over concrete under stairs.\n\nSCULLERY: 2.45m x 2.90m\nLinoleum over concrete floor. Painted plastered walls. Boarded timber ceiling.\n\nSITTING ROOM: 3.90m x 3.60m\nSuspended timber floor. Painted plastered ceiling. Boarded walls. Wall hung central heating radiator.\n\n\nBEDROOM 1: 2.15m x 2.20m\nLinoleum over concrete floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling. Wall hung central heating radiator.\n\nENSUITE: 1.60m x 2.20m\nCeramic tile floor and floor-to-ceiling wall tiling. Dished shower area with electric shower. Wash hand basin & pedestal, toilet pan and wall hung central heating radiator.\n\nSTAIRS TO FIRST FLOOR:Carpet over timber stairs.\n\nFIRST FLOOR\n\nLANDING/HALL: 0.85m x 6.25m\nCarpet over timber floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling.\n\nWC: 0.80m x 1.55m\nCarpet over timber floor. Painted plastered ceiling. Part boarded walls and part painted plastered walls. Wash hand basin & pedestal and toilet pan.\n\nBEDROOM 2: 3.65m x 2.00m + 1.90m x 1.00m\nCarpet over timber floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling. Wall hung central heating radiator.\n\nBEDROOM 3: 3.65m x 3.25m\nCarpet over timber floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling. Attic opening. Wall hung central heating radiator. Built-in wardrobe.\n\nBUILT-IN WARDROBE: 1.00m x 0.75m\n\nBEDROOM 4: 2.25m x 2.70m\nCarpet over timber floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling. Wall hung central heating radiator.\n\nBEDROOM 5: 2.20m x 3.40m\nCarpet over timber floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling. Wall hung central heating radiator. Built-in wardrobe.\n\nBUILT-IN WARDROBE: 0.50m x 0.75m\n\nThis property has been maintained in good decorative order. Outside at front is an enclosed garden with perimeter Cotoneaster hedging. At side & rear is a large yard & garden. A derelict stone built granary is sited perpendicular to the rear of the farmhouse and this could be restored and integrated as additional residential accommodation. Mature Leylandii hedging separates the residence from the yard & garden. Gated vehicular access from the passing side road to the yard.\n\nThe overall accommodation area measures approximately 106.40 square metres (1,145 sq ft). The overall site area measures approximately 1750 square metres.\n"
      },
